<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are conducting combat-readiness patrols and water-cannon drills around Scarborough Shoal and Panatag Shoal, while a carrier group including Liaoning entered the western Pacific, prompting alarms from the Philippines, Taiwan and Japan. The Philippine Coast Guard is delivering fuel to Filipino fishermen at Scarborough Shoal and jointly conducting a search-and-rescue exercise with the US Coast Guard in the West Philippine Sea. A ferry listing off Quezon Province was rescued, saving 58 passengers. The conflict recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOLVZHNlp6YnVjYmw4N0c2cjlxQ3hCcEZuR1pLUko3aXp3SE9jdEtiVXZqeC1UZTRhMzZaTTdWTVo2Rmdyck1scDFMVk5Ga1U5WkZVZm4zUWVzZVptV09zUVhHdUdQYnJ0YlVzV3NmWVVna3IwRVhBOU5BcHRyUHk0eDh5bUhTaWVpMlhvNG9CU0h2OG9vWWhtdmFhdnVLbzRtTVk0MkNFM1lXVWtTUmZOQ0Zwcnpld2lkU0kwa1oyeGNQRlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNelRKZ21DWjJBX09xRTJyZnBicWsyLWJTQk1CcmVoVFJYLXBIcWt6LWpwdDRyeGhzbFpNaUFmV0ZhM0NuWmNVRXpKd2s2QnY3bTdwTUFJSFBoUEVUNjlWbThFLXpxN0dkRklMYy1JQVZhWW5abUNtQlZYc21la2htWWVzUWVBMjhTMHc5OF80V3EzLWVPQmFhZnFyOExtWEVfeFhsMnVOYzdfakc1NHdIMjN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFA5dzEtR25xZTlHdi1QdkxiUHlFTG9TZGdlTkRJRTdHY3lpMnZ2WDZQVGpaV1dqc0ZoN1NtU3V2ZGIxQ21yNzA4Q0VPekRUWWhWTnoxcmlucDZHdF8yQnlldnVxU2wzSFhDUTM4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wake Up Singapore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;BusinessToday Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&l